### v10.3 — 2m Surge Detection · AI Insight Navigation · Fixes

- **Surge detection bug**: 2m was explicitly excluded from `analyze_surges()` → no alert even during strong visible Es openings. Fixed: 2m reintroduced with an adaptive ×2.0 threshold and a minimum of 8 spots (instead of 3) to avoid false positives from ongoing local/EME 2m activity
- `Cluster … closed the connection (EOFError)` log downgraded from WARNING to INFO — this is normal failover between multiple DX clusters, not an anomaly
- "AI Insight" links fixed in `index.html`, `satellites.html` — still pointed to `/analysis.html` following the v10.2 rename
- `map-v11.html` page (unified map prototype, obsolete after integration into the cockpit) removed from the project
- DX Cluster list updated: removed `cluster.dx.de:7300` (systematic timeout) and `telnet.wxc.kr:23` (dead DNS), added `dxc.k0xm.net:7300` and `dxc.nc7j.com:7373` (reliable), kept `dxfun.com:8000`

