### v10.2 — TLE JSON OMM Format Migration (CelesTrak) · Favicon · Page Renamed to AI Insight

#### 🛰️ Satellite Catalog Compatibility — Post-July 2026

CelesTrak will exhaust 5-digit catalog numbers (limit 69999) around **July 12, 2026** — preventive migration.

- `TLE_JSON_SOURCES`: CelesTrak GP API `gp.php?GROUP=amateur&FORMAT=json` + `GROUP=stations&FORMAT=json`
- `_fetch_all_tles()` now returns `(json_tles, fallback_text)` instead of plain text
- `_load_tle_cache()` merges JSON as priority + AMSAT `nasa.all` text as fallback for missing satellites
- `NORAD_CAT_ID` native unlimited integer, `TLE_LINE1`/`TLE_LINE2` compatible with `sgp4.twoline2rv()` unchanged

#### ⚡ Favicon

Inline base64 SVG ⚡ favicon across all templates (no extra file) — fixed a bug where an old 📡 favicon had been concatenated instead of replaced, leaving orphaned SVG fragments visible at the top of the page.

#### 🧠 Page Renamed: Analysis → AI Insight

Template `analysis.html` → `ai_insight.html`, new route `/ai-insight` (+ `/ai_insight` alias), old `/analysis` and `/analysis.html` routes kept as automatic redirects.

#### 🎨 AI Insight Page Improvements

Missing CSS variables fixed (`--font-sans`, `--font-display`, `--success`), `fillList()` enriched for Long Distance (distance km + band + mode + time), rare calls now clickable (quick add to watchlist), native `confirm()` replaced by an inline HTML dialog for META analysis (contextual error message on 500), last-update indicator + refresh spinner, global FR/EN language toggle persisted in localStorage, improved Chart.js (custom tooltips, `easeOutQuart` animation, adaptive 220px height).

